@startuml
title SplitSmart - Proposed Component Boundaries

actor User
component "Swing Presentation\nsplitsmart.ui" as UI
component "Application Workflows\nsplitsmart.application" as APP
component "Domain Model and Policies\nsplitsmart.domain" as DOMAIN
interface "Repository / Identity Ports" as PORTS
interface "Notification / Receipt Ports" as EFFECTS
component "Approved Infrastructure Adapters\nsplitsmart.infrastructure" as INFRA

User --> UI : interacts
UI --> APP : use-case requests / results
APP --> DOMAIN : validate and apply domain behavior
APP --> PORTS : load and save through abstractions
APP --> EFFECTS : request external effects
INFRA ..|> PORTS
INFRA ..|> EFFECTS
note right of INFRA
  No adapter technology selected.
  Add only approved implementations.
end note
note bottom of DOMAIN
  No Swing or infrastructure dependency.
  All monetary values use BigDecimal.
end note
@enduml
